subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Manage tags

USAGE:
  subtrack [COMMANDS] <OPTIONS>

COMMANDS:
  [tag] <OPTIONS>          Manage tags
  delete <OPTIONS>         Delete a tag and its associations
  list <OPTIONS>           List all tags with usage count
  merge <OPTIONS>          Merge source tag into target tag
  prune <OPTIONS>          Remove orphaned tags
  rename <OPTIONS>         Rename a tag

For more info, run any command with the `--help` flag:
  subtrack tag --help
  subtrack tag delete --help
  subtrack tag list --help
  subtrack tag merge --help
  subtrack tag prune --help
  subtrack tag rename --help

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help             Display this help message
  -v, --version          Display this version

